  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Awards Africa 2022-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia Awards Africa Program contributes to African leadership and human capacity development through the delivery of scholarships and short course awards in key areas of development including agriculture and food security, climate change, mining and energy, foreign policy and international security and gender, disability and social inclusion. This funding covers costs associated with the managing contractor to implement the program on behalf of the Australian Government and includes the selection and mobilisation of awardees, Africa short course awards, alumni engagement and monitoring and evaluation.</narrative>
  </description>
